{"id":"n33494-1-2","stage":2,"title":"금 · 周五","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n33494-1-2-1","ko":"너 2박 3일로 여행 간다며?","zh":"你说你要去旅行，是2晚3天对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"2박","meaning":"夜，宿","explanation":"박：夜，宿；2：数字。","readings":[{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57517","senseId":"1","lemma":"박","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"3일로","meaning":"日","explanation":"일：日；3：数字。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62598","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간다며?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"a2ed2af4650eb11c","term":"박","zh":"夜，宿","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3","entryId":"57517","definition":"计算离家在外留宿次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"日","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"62598","definition":"计算日或日子的单位。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。"